 [('The author gives short ___ to grassroots speakers. (shrift)','shrift','expressão.',None),('The book is not ___ flaws. (without)','without','litotes.',None),('___, these are quibbles about a book of rare clarity. (still)','Still','contraste.',None),('Anyone who has wondered ___ find answers here. (will)','will','futuro de recomendação.',None)],
