 ('Book club',[('Rita','Did you finish The Podium and the People?','Você terminou The Podium and the People?'),('Omar','Yes. It’s not without flaws, but it’s absorbing.','Sim. Tem falhas, mas é envolvente.'),('Rita','What bothered you?','O que o incomodou?'),('Omar','She gives short shrift to grassroots speakers.','Ela dá pouca atenção aos oradores de base.')]),
 [('Praise a book.','Elogie.','It is a brisk, absorbing study.'),('Voice a mild criticism with litotes.','Critique.','It is not without flaws.'),('Recommend with a verdict.','Recomende.','Highly recommended for anyone who loves rhetoric.')],
